<title>SWITZERLAND: Sources say WTO finds against Japan on liquor tax.</title>
<headline>Sources say WTO finds against Japan on liquor tax.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade diplomats confirmed reports from Tokyo that a World Trade Organisation appeals panel had ruled against Japan over its liquor taxation system.</p>
<p>The diplomats said they understood the panel findings, of which they had no details, had been sent to the Japanese government and to the European Commission in Brussels.</p>
<p>The EU brought the case against Japan. (Geneva newsroom -- 41-22-733-38-31)</p>
</text>
